# The painting read left to right; a line with dots; whole vs part; entering 3D; a region from the centre.
# Source: owner, chat 1 T108.
LANGUAGE RSOS 0.2
WORLD thermal_engineering
SCENE painting ORDER mountains, sky, house, grass, car, road LIGHT engineering
PART house.door KIND module
PART car.seat KIND module
SELECT mountains.top PART
SELECT house.door WHOLE
SELECT house.door.middle PART
ENTER car.seat DEPTH 2
REGION r1 SHAPE triangle CENTER car SIZE 0.4 INCLUDES engine, seat, window
LINE l1 THROUGH mountains.top, house.door.middle, car.seat, road.white_line PAUSE car.seat
LINE l2 THROUGH grass.top, sky, car, road FROM left
REGION r2 SHAPE square CENTER road.white_line SIZE 0.2
WIDEN l1 TO tube RADIUS 0.2
